Rem Screen Open 1,640,200,16,Hires 
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Flash Off : Curs Off : Hide 
Screen To Front 0 : Screen 0
Reserve As Data 1,128
Load Iff "hd1:gfx/Example_resource.iff",0
Set Sprite Buffer 512


Wait Vbl 
DY=16

SY=11
Get Sprite 1,0,SY To 16,SY+DY
Get Sprite 2,0,50 To 16,66
Rem Get Sprite Palette 


Wait Key 
Cls 
X=150
Y=100
Sprite 1,X,Y,1
Sprite 2,X+100,Y+200,2
Rem Sprite Update  
Wait Key 

M=Free
Print "Free memory ",M

